<title>JAPAN: Charle shares bid-only in early Tokyo.</title>
<headline>Charle shares bid-only in early Tokyo.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Charle Co Ltd were bid-only in early Tokyo trade on Monday on Friday's news that the women's underwear maker would buy back up to 3.3 million of its own shares, or up to four billion yen worth.</p>
<p>As of 0043 GMT, the shares were bid only at 1,440 yen on the over-the-counter market, compared with the Friday close of 1,400 yen, which was a high for this calendar year.</p>
